# Torch the Tower: "If a permanent dealt damage by Torch the Tower would die this turn, exile it instead." Bot2 answers it
# with Healing Salve's shield on its Llanowar Elves, so all 2 of Torch's damage is prevented and the Elves were never dealt
# damage by it (CR 615.1). When Bot1's Lightning Bolt then kills the Elves (1 of its 3 prevented, 2 dealt), they die and go
# to the graveyard - not to exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Torch the Tower
Lightning Bolt
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mox Pearl
Healing Salve
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Torch the Tower.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Healing Salve.Cast
Bot2.Modes(Prevent the next 3 damage)
Bot2.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Damage = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves; Healing Salve
Exile.Count = 0
Prevented = 2 Torch the Tower > Llanowar Elves by Healing Salve; 1 Lightning Bolt > Llanowar Elves by Healing Salve
